  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Breaking: `TestingTaskRunner.Run` is now `Start`, and returns nothing,** since the runner observes each actor's task itself, and throws its failure on dispose. A test that awaits one actor itself runs it with the new `RunAsync`, which returns its task, and which the runner observes too. Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers warned of each call to `Run` that discarded its task (VSTHRD110), and beside `RunAsync`, a `Run` would read as its blocking twin, to readers and the analyzers alike.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.10.0-internal (was 0.8.0-internal), Compze.Threading 0.13.0-alpha (was 0.12.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
